{"name":"한조","description":"궁수이자 암살자로서 실력을 연마한 시마다 한조는 자신이 타의 추종을 불허하는 전사임을 증명하려고 애씁니다.","backgrounds":[{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltc0d234821924210d/631a8b503ab6f40dd2a906a9/960_Hanzo.jpg","sizes":["min","xs","sm"]},{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt94cbaa8364b60dc7/631a8b50eef3ae0e03c743aa/1600_Hanzo.jpg","sizes":["md","lg"]},{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt6ea101bee04bc99e/631a8b505f39a30d9cedbac8/2600_Hanzo.jpg","sizes":["xl+"]}],"portrait":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/78b61c3e806fb26b02b8980fba62189155074fc15bd865b0883268e546030be5.png","role":"damage","subrole":"sharpshooter","location":"일본, 하나무라(이전 기록)","birthday":"11월 3일","age":40,"hitpoints":{"shields":0,"health":250,"armor":0,"total":250},"abilities":[{"name":"폭풍활","description":"누르고 있다가 떼면 화살을 더 멀리 쏩니다.","icon":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/e38382e38d83492de12d3428bc30ef2f8833f8cef89298daa5a5a6d0b4420269.png","video":{"thumbnail":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt449c98c3bd71efd8/633905cb3922a2677fc88d1c/HANZO_Storm_Bow.jpg","link":{"mp4":"https://blz-contentstack-assets.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt5554fe947fa16d90/633905d0e3c2a2741688cbb9/OVERWATCH_WEBSITE_CHARACTER_CAPTURE_HanzoStormBow_WEB_16x9_1920x1080p30_H264.mp4","webm":"https://blz-contentstack-assets.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt47b44e3f8cffdb59/6679aabe2309b554d8e269e7/OVERWATCH_WEBSITE_CHARACTER_CAPTURE_HanzoStormBow_WEB_16x9_1920x1080p30_WEBM.webm"}}},{"name":"폭풍 화살","description":"감소된 위력의 화살 5발을 즉시 발사할 수 있습니다. 이 화살은 지면이나 벽에 닿으면 튕깁니다.","icon":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/5b2a2a02cf8087005216db110ab5aba37112eeca29c32f4491abb29caeb1910b.png","video":{"thumbnail":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt84